Z||000070||MinnGreenGT||12-17-2001||10:03 AM||||I'm jumping into this thread a little late... oh well.<P><BR>FieroGal- you said you're near LaCrosse...anywhere specific?  My Brother & his wife live/work in Winona.  Also another member here (86seyellow) lives just north of Winona (Wabasha?).  It's a small world!   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"> So, what do you drive? You'll have to drive up sometime (next spring I assume) when we have another PFF Fiero gathering, they're a blast (we usually meet at the Mall of America on a Saturday afternoon).  Welcome!<P>[EDIT]About the Bra issue: yes, it may cause some paint issues- but it also hides them as well <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif">. I rear-ended another car about 9 months after I had the car painted (years ago).  During the fix they undercoated the new paint with a slightly different color paint- and it looks a little wacky.  So I covered it up! It'll get another repaint in the next year or so anyway (new body parts).[/EDIT]<P>------------------<BR>               <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/GreenGT6.gif">  <p>[This message has been edited by MinnGreenGT (edited 12-17-2001).]||||reg||1
